msgid "A little preparation makes room for a better conversation. [smile]\n\nTake your time. Leave space for a pause. Your next words will be here when you are ready."
msgstr "Malo pripreme otvara prostor za bolji razgovor. [osmijeh]\n\nNe žurite. Ostavite mjesta za stanku. Sljedeće riječi bit će ovdje kad budete spremni."

msgid "A little preparation makes room for a better conversation. [smile] Take your time. Read the first sentence aloud and watch the words follow you."
msgstr "Malo pripreme otvara prostor za bolji razgovor. [osmijeh] Ne žurite. Pročitajte prvu rečenicu naglas i gledajte kako vas riječi prate."

